                                "zh": "许多人喜欢菲律宾传统甜点中<w>紫薯</w>的独特风味。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The bakery is famous for its delicious <w>ube</w> ice-cream.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
